    "detailed_description": "<h1>PROJECT: STELLAR GIRLS</h1><p></p><br><h1>Project: Mirror</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1718128643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1718128643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/71af66723ed3873ea6e79c7cabdb573c.avif?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><br>FANCY! is an exciting puzzle game with delicious, sweet candy combinations!  You will find many bright and varied visuals and very beautiful music. In this game you need to correctly match the same candies in a row so that they disappear (no matter in which direction), collect points, and open new levels. After each completed level, you will discover new pictures ! Collect the required number of points and conquer one level after another!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/d2960a16f0869cc3c842999a416e0dbd.avif?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><br>With &quot;FANCY!&quot; You will be able to breathe from difficult games, you will immerse yourself in the world of various, colorful candies and nice music. Here you will find an amazing variety of new levels, a beautiful gallery, animation and pleasant music! Collecting colorful candies will become more and more interesting with each new level! Enjoy an interesting game! Many interesting levels with stunning graphics are waiting for you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/8e2ceba1f28c6bfa5a00dfa11e2e680f.avif?t=1718128643\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173730/extras/215b15c5c010cad5ee25ebc528bee4b6.webp?t=1718128643\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you can find in this game:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging and interesting levels at the same time.<br></li><li>Incredible graphics and animation.<br></li><li>Incredible sound and visual effects.<br></li><li>Funny levels.<br></li><li>Relax and have a great time.<br></li><li>Enjoy your day with cute girls.</li></ul>",
